            <ArticleTitle>Late restenosis related to cypher stent fracture.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e72-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0066-782X2009001100021</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Drug-eluting stents represent a significant evolution in the therapy of coronary artery disease. Recently, restenosis and thrombosis related to drug-eluting stent fractures have been described. This work reports a case of fracture of a drug-eluting stent 18 months after implantation, associated with restenosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
